## Development Workflow

This project uses:
- [uv](https://docs.astral.sh/uv/) for dependency management
- [Ruff](https://docs.astral.sh/ruff/) for linting/formatting
- [basedpyright](https://docs.basedpyright.com/latest/) for strict type checking
- [pytest](https://docs.pytest.org/en/stable/) for testing
- [Justfiles](https://github.com/casey/just) to run various commands

### Setup
To get started, and using this project, run
```bash
copier copy path/to/project/template path/to/destination
```
Then,
   ```bash
   uv sync --dev
   ```
